From: Project Luma <luma@local>
Subject: [PATCH] Include GioUnix in the Shell introspection namespace

Fedora 44 exposes GDesktopAppInfo from GioUnix-2.0 rather than Gio-2.0.
Without that include, g-ir-scanner marks Shell.App:app-info and
Shell.App.get_app_info() non-introspectable, and GNOME Mobile aborts while
constructing its dash.
---
 src/meson.build | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/meson.build b/src/meson.build
index a3f5c24..f49e93c 100644
--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -264,5 +264,6 @@ libshell_gir_includes = [
   'Clutter-@0@'.format(mutter_api_version),
   'Meta-@0@'.format(mutter_api_version),
+  'GioUnix-2.0',
   'Gcr-4',
   'PolkitAgent-1.0',
   'GdkPixbuf-2.0'
-- 
2.51.0
